---
import PengoLayout from "../../layouts/PengoLayout.astro";
---

<PengoLayout
  title="Privacy | Pengo Systems"
  description="Privacy information for the Pengo Systems website."
  url="https://pengosystems.com/privacy/"
>
  <main class="site-page">
    <section class="site-page-content">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Privacy information for the Pengo Systems website.
      </p>

      <section>
        <h2>Information We May Collect</h2>
        <p>
          Pengo Systems may collect basic information needed to operate, secure,
          understand, and improve the website.
        </p>
        <p>
          This may include server logs, browser and device information, pages visited,
          referring pages, approximate location derived from network information,
          and information you choose to send by email.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Email Communications</h2>
        <p>
          If you contact Pengo Systems by email, we receive the information included
          in your message, such as your email address, message content, and any
          related context you provide.
        </p>
        <p>
          General questions may be sent to
          <a href="mailto:info@pengosystems.com">info@pengosystems.com</a>.
          Billing questions may be sent to
          <a href="mailto:billing@pengosystems.com">billing@pengosystems.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Analytics and Site Measurement</h2>
        <p>
          Pengo Systems may use analytics, performance, or site measurement tools
          to understand site usage, improve pages, monitor reliability, and evaluate
          public interest in Workbench and related materials.
        </p>
        <p>
          If advertising pixels, retargeting tags, or similar marketing tools are
          added later, this page may be updated to describe that use.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>How Information May Be Used</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To operate and maintain the website.</li>
          <li>To respond to messages and billing inquiries.</li>
          <li>To understand which public pages are being used.</li>
          <li>To improve site content, navigation, reliability, and security.</li>
          <li>To protect the website from abuse, spam, or misuse.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>No Sale of Personal Information</h2>
        <p>
          Pengo Systems does not sell personal information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
          The website may rely on third-party services for hosting, DNS, security,
          email, analytics, delivery, or related operations. These services may
          process information as needed to provide their services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>
          This privacy page may be updated as the website, Workbench, analytics,
          contact options, or related services change.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For privacy questions, contact
          <a href="mailto:info@pengosystems.com">info@pengosystems.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </section>
  </main>
</PengoLayout>
